{"seq":2,"slug":"reading-comprehension","title":"高三英语 — 阅读理解","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/gaokao-skills/reading-comprehension","wordCount":2051,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三英语-阅读理解\">高三英语 — 阅读理解</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>阅读理解是高考英语的分值重镇，全国卷和新高考卷中阅读理解（含七选五）分值达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 分，占总分的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33%</span></span></span></span></span>。阅读理解共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 篇文章 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 篇七选五，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 道题，涵盖应用文、记叙文、说明文和议论文四种体裁。高考阅读的难度梯度从 A 篇（简单应用文）递增到 D 篇（较难议论文或说明文），七选五位于最后。高三复习阶段需要将阅读速度提升到每分钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span></span></span></span></span> 个词，同时保持 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上的正确率。</p>\n<p>阅读理解的题型分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>题型</th>\n<th>考查内容</th>\n<th>出题频率</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>细节理解</td>\n<td>文中具体信息的定位与理解</td>\n<td>最高（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理判断</td>\n<td>根据文本推断隐含信息</td>\n<td>高（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主旨大意</td>\n<td>文章或段落的中心思想</td>\n<td>中（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词义猜测</td>\n<td>根据语境推断生词含义</td>\n<td>较低（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-阅读理解的基本流程\">一、阅读理解的基本流程</h3><p>高效阅读的核心是&quot;先看题目后读文章&quot;——明确阅读目的后再有针对性地读文章。</p>\n<p><strong>标准阅读流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>浏览题目</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）：读四道题的题干（不看选项），标注关键词，判断每道题属于什么题型</li>\n<li><strong>快速通读文章</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）：边读边在题目关键词对应处做标记</li>\n<li><strong>逐题解答</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）：回到标记处精读相关段落，比对选项</li>\n</ol>\n<p>总用时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟/篇。四篇加七选五共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟完成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-细节理解题\">二、细节理解题</h3><p>细节题是最基础也是最重要的题型。答案一定在文中——不需要推理，只需要精准定位和比对。</p>\n<p><strong>解题步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>圈出题目中的关键词（人名、数字、专有名词、核心名词）</li>\n<li>在原文中定位对应段落和句子</li>\n<li>将原文信息与选项逐一比对</li>\n<li>注意选项的&quot;同义替换&quot;——正确选项通常是原文的改写而非原词照搬</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>细节题常见干扰项类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>干扰类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>识别方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>张冠李戴</td>\n<td>信息正确但归属错误</td>\n<td>检查主语是否与原文一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间错位</td>\n<td>将过去的事说成现在</td>\n<td>注意时态和时间标志词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>程度偷换</td>\n<td>&quot;可能&quot;变&quot;一定&quot;，&quot;部分&quot;变&quot;全部&quot;</td>\n<td>注意限定词 some/all/most/always</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无中生有</td>\n<td>选项内容在文中找不到</td>\n<td>能否在原文中找到对应句？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度推断</td>\n<td>在细节题中加入推理</td>\n<td>细节题不需要推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-推理判断题\">三、推理判断题</h3><p>推理判断题要求&quot;从文本已有信息出发做合理推断&quot;，答案不在文中直接出现，但一定能从文中找到依据。</p>\n<p><strong>常见设问方式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;It can be inferred from the passage that...&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;What can we learn from the last paragraph?&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;The author implies that...&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;Which of the following can be concluded?&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>解题原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推理不等于猜测——必须有文本依据</li>\n<li>正确答案往往是&quot;文中信息的延伸&quot;而非&quot;凭空想象&quot;</li>\n<li>错误选项通常要么&quot;推得太远&quot;，要么&quot;方向相反&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"四-主旨大意题\">四、主旨大意题</h3><p>主旨题考查对全文或某段落核心思想的把握。</p>\n<p><strong>常见设问方式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;What is the main idea of the passage?&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;What is the best title for the passage?&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;What does the passage mainly discuss?&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;What is the purpose of the passage?&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>解题策略</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首段首句法</td>\n<td>关注文章第一段和每段首句</td>\n<td>英语文章通常在首段点明主旨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频词法</td>\n<td>找出全文反复出现的核心词</td>\n<td>主旨必然包含这些词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排除法</td>\n<td>排除以偏概全和过于宽泛的选项</td>\n<td>只涵盖某一段的不是全文主旨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构法</td>\n<td>分析文章的整体结构</td>\n<td>总分总结构的&quot;总&quot;就是主旨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选标题的特殊技巧</strong>：好标题应该既概括全文内容又有吸引力，既不过于笼统也不过于具体。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-词义猜测题\">五、词义猜测题</h3><p>词义猜测题要求根据上下文推断生词或短语的含义。</p>\n<p><strong>猜词方法</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>线索</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义线索</td>\n<td>that is, which means, in other words</td>\n<td>&quot;Pedagogy, that is, the art of teaching&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>举例线索</td>\n<td>such as, for example, like</td>\n<td>通过例子反推上义词含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对比线索</td>\n<td>but, while, however, unlike</td>\n<td>对比词的反义即为答案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果线索</td>\n<td>because, since, so</td>\n<td>从因果关系推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构词线索</td>\n<td>前缀/后缀/词根</td>\n<td>un- = not, re- = again</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文语境</td>\n<td>通读前后句理解</td>\n<td>最通用但也最需要语感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-七选五的解题策略\">六、七选五的解题策略</h3><p>七选五（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 分）从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 个选项中选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 个填入文章空缺处。</p>\n<p><strong>解题步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>通读全文</strong>：理解文章结构和每段主旨</li>\n<li><strong>分析空缺位置</strong>：<ul>\n<li>段首空缺 → 通常是段落主题句</li>\n<li>段中空缺 → 通常是承接上文或引出下文的过渡句</li>\n<li>段尾空缺 → 通常是总结句或过渡句</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>利用衔接线索</strong>：<ul>\n<li>代词衔接（this, that, these, it 指代上文内容）</li>\n<li>逻辑连接词（however, therefore, besides）</li>\n<li>词汇复现（原文和选项中出现相同或相关的词）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>逐一验证</strong>：填入后通读该段落检查连贯性</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>七选五的核心技巧</strong>：先做有把握的空，缩小剩余选项的范围，最后用排除法确定难度较大的空。</p>\n<h3 id=\"七-各篇阅读的应对策略\">七、各篇阅读的应对策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>篇目</th>\n<th>体裁</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n<th>策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A 篇</td>\n<td>应用文（广告、通知、活动介绍）</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>快速扫读，定位关键信息，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 篇</td>\n<td>记叙文或说明文</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>关注故事线或说明对象的特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 篇</td>\n<td>说明文或社科类</td>\n<td>中等偏难</td>\n<td>关注文章结构和论点论据关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D 篇</td>\n<td>议论文或科技类</td>\n<td>较难</td>\n<td>先读题目定位段落，不必逐词阅读</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选取一套高考真题阅读理解，为每道题标注其题型（细节/推理/主旨/词义），统计各类型的数量分布。</li>\n<li>用&quot;先看题目后读文章&quot;的方法做一篇 C 篇或 D 篇阅读，与你之前&quot;先读文章后看题目&quot;的方法比较，哪种更高效？</li>\n<li>从最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 次模考中找出所有细节理解题的错题，分析其干扰项属于哪种类型（张冠李戴/时间错位/程度偷换/无中生有/过度推断）。</li>\n<li>限时训练：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟内完成四篇阅读理解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 一篇七选五（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 题），记录正确率和各篇用时。</li>\n<li>积累一份&quot;高考阅读高频主题词汇表&quot;，涵盖科技、环保、教育、文化等常见话题，每个话题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 个核心词。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>英语原版杂志如 National Geographic、Scientific American 和 The Economist 的文章风格接近高考阅读 C/D 篇，适合提升高级阅读能力。</li>\n<li>SQ3R 阅读法（Survey-Question-Read-Recite-Review）是经典的学术阅读策略，与高考阅读的&quot;先看题后读文&quot;方法一脉相承。</li>\n<li>词汇量是阅读能力的基石——研究表明，理解一篇文章至少需要认识其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 的词汇。高考阅读词汇量要求约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3500</span></span></span></span></span> 词。</li>\n<li>每天坚持阅读 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 篇英语短文（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> 词），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个月后阅读速度和准确率会有显著提升。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>阅读理解的备考核心是&quot;分题型掌握策略，分体裁调整方法&quot;。细节题靠精准定位和逐选项比对，推理判断题靠从文本出发做&quot;有据推断&quot;，主旨大意题靠首段首句和高频词法，词义猜测题靠定义/对比/因果/构词四种线索。七选五重点利用代词衔接、逻辑连接词和词汇复现三种线索。四篇阅读的策略因难度而异——A 篇快速扫读，D 篇先读题目再有针对性地读文章。总用时控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span></span></span></span></span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，目标正确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三英语 — 阅读理解","id":"高三英语-阅读理解"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、阅读理解的基本流程","id":"一-阅读理解的基本流程"},{"level":3,"text":"二、细节理解题","id":"二-细节理解题"},{"level":3,"text":"三、推理判断题","id":"三-推理判断题"},{"level":3,"text":"四、主旨大意题","id":"四-主旨大意题"},{"level":3,"text":"五、词义猜测题","id":"五-词义猜测题"},{"level":3,"text":"六、七选五的解题策略","id":"六-七选五的解题策略"},{"level":3,"text":"七、各篇阅读的应对策略","id":"七-各篇阅读的应对策略"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三英语 — 完形填空","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/gaokao-skills/cloze-test"},"next":{"title":"高三英语 — 读后续写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/english/gaokao-skills/continuation-writing"}}